OL,4,BDurham appoint Gibson as head coach    
OL,5,GDurham have appointed Ottis Gibson as  
OL,6,Gtheir head coach on a three-year deal. 
OL,8,FThe 57-year-old takes over from Ryan   
OL,9,FCampbell, who moved up to the director 
OL,10,Fof cricket role in September.          
OL,12,FCampbell led the team to promotion     
OL,13,Fback to Division One of the County     
OL,14,FChampionship this year before stepping 
OL,15,Finto the role vacated by Marcus North  
OL,16,Fleaving to join England as national    
OL,17,Fselector.                              
